Risks / limitations
- it is an acid: rinse well before the next drink, avoid splashing it on
  stone or marble counters and skin
- only use food-grade citric acid
- do not submerge the base or any electronics, never use it on a
  cracked or badly damaged kettle
- aluminium parts can be etched by acid - check the manual first
- very heavy scale may need 2 cycles
